== Notes ==
* Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
* This form of shapeshifting cannot be [[dispel]]led.
* This feat does not actually require one to be an epic shifter. It can be taken starting on shifter level 10 (when the shifter gets [[greater wildshape IV]]).
* Unlike the other epic shifter [[feat]]s, ''undead shape'' does not require a minimum [[wisdom]] score.

