* All undead shapes receive the following immunities: [[disease]], [[critical hit]]s, [[death magic]], [[level drain]], [[ability drain]], [[mind-affecting]] spells, [[paralysis]], [[poison]], and [[sneak attack]]s.
* Drinking healing potions in any undead shape will be treated as a hostile touch attack action which will harm the character if the attack roll succeeds.
* Off-hand weapon and bracer/gauntlet/glove properties never merge.

'''Spectre'''
* The +2 turn resistance provides no benefit for a player character.

